     [38;5;246mLean core plus the due date that makes later notifications meaningful. Everything else deferred until you miss it.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Just id, title, done, timestamps
     [38;5;246mAbsolute minimum. Fastest to build, but leaves the only useful single-user notification (due soon) with nothing to
